Subject: [PATCH 13/16] fix-mr-3: T-17 job titles on one line (line breaks and
 runs of whitespace are one space), in the norm-13 bump

cleanTitle in normalizeJob and relabelJobs (stored snapshots): Meta "Research Scientist,\nMachine Learning ..." and
Amazon's two "...\n, ..." titles read as one line; words and order as posted, a posted space before a comma kept.
362 titles change on the 2026-10-16 crawl (3 line breaks, 340 double spaces, 19 non-breaking spaces). Golden
re-baselined once for norm-13 (MR-40 and T-17) with UPDATE_GOLDEN: 3 of 300 hashes changed, all double-spaced titles.

